{
  "uid": "netpol-coverage",
  "title": "Network segmentation — the programme, and how far it has got",
  "tags": [
    "security",
    "network-policy",
    "mdapi"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "links": [],
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 36,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "version": 2,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**This is the platform's weakest control, and it is on screen on purpose.** Risk R-01, severity *high*: there is no deny-by-default floor, and most namespaces carrying pods have no policy at all.\n\nThe numbers below distinguish three different things that are easy to confuse. **Onboarded** means a namespace has entered the segmentation programme — a declared policy set, reviewed. **Policies outside the programme** are ad-hoc NetworkPolicies that exist but were never part of a design; they protect something, but nobody guarantees what. **The floor** is the cluster-wide deny-by-default that would make every undeclared flow an unauthorised flow.\n\nMeasuring a programme that has not started yet is deliberate: the instrumentation comes first, so that progress is visible from the first namespace rather than claimed at the end. Source: `f/probe/netpol_coverage`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Namespaces onboarded",
      "description": "Namespaces inside the segmentation programme. 0 today: the programme is defined and instrumented, not begun.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "netpol_onboarded_total",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Onboarded without a policy",
      "description": "Onboarded but still unprotected — the gap that matters once the programme starts moving.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "netpol_onboarded_no_policy",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Policies outside the programme",
      "description": "Namespaces carrying NetworkPolicies that are not part of a reviewed design. They are not nothing, but they are not a guarantee either.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "netpol_policy_ns_not_onboarded_total",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Deny-by-default floor",
      "description": "0 means any flow not explicitly denied is permitted. This is the single change that would move R-01 from high to moderate.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "netpol_floor_present",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "YES",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Onboarding progress — the only line that matters here",
      "description": "Flat at zero is the honest current state. The instrumentation exists so that the first real movement is visible the day it happens.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "netpol_onboarded_total",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "onboarded"
        },
        {
          "expr": "netpol_onboarded_no_policy",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "onboarded, still no policy"
        },
        {
          "expr": "netpol_policy_ns_not_onboarded_total",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "policies outside the programme"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Policy logging — is the volume survivable?",
      "description": "A deny-by-default floor is only deployable if its logging does not drown the node. Measuring this BEFORE enabling the floor is what makes the rollout plannable rather than a gamble.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "netpol_log_lines_per_hour",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "log lines/h — {{node}}"
        },
        {
          "expr": "netpol_log_burst_budget_used_ratio * 100",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "burst budget used % — {{node}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        }
      }
    },
